## Methodology

Search executed by paper-search-pro using OpenAlex (primary) and Semantic Scholar (supplement). See `execution_log.json` for the PRISMA-S 16-item checklist and full discovery curve snapshots.

Coverage is an LLM-estimated saturation heuristic, not a PRISMA-validated recall figure. Treat the result set as a candidate corpus for downstream screening.
